Changelog: 09-10-2026 21:53:42

install.sh --uninstall now asks about each other suite app that is installed before it removes anything: y
uninstalls it with its own uninstaller (from the release the portal kept, or staged from the checkout), s skips
it, c cancels the whole uninstall. Without a terminal nothing is asked and those apps stay, as before.

